# Keep secrets, local state and build output out of Docker build contexts.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
apps/api/uploads
# Tests are not needed in the images (and their tools are not installed there).
apps/*/test
config/test
packages/*/test
e2e
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/api/src/generated
.git
.github
docs
*.md
